# Archived pre-Postgres SQLite databases (contain user password hashes).
# Ignore everything in the folder except the revert instructions, which are
# worth keeping in version control. Note the timestamped .bak files do not end
# in .db, so the patterns above would not catch them.
sqlite-archive/*
!sqlite-archive/README.md

